retriever balance problems from scores alone. preferred_retriever must be null unless justified.
decision is pass/retry/clarify/escalate. Pass requires a complete supported answer, valid
citations, evidence_sufficient=true and no unresolved failure_types. Clarify only when essential
USER information is missing, and provide the specific clarification_question. Do not ask the user
to supply facts that should come from retrieval. Escalate explicit human requests or actions
the assistant cannot execute. suggested_action is regenerate/rewrite_query/adjust_hybrid/rerank
or an empty string. suggested_queries must remain about the original user request.
